Done. `/work/submission.csv` written with matching ids/columns.

- Model: LightGBM with native categoricals, delay-derived features (total delay, delay per distance, delay flag), and service rating aggregates.
- 5-fold CV ROC AUC: **0.9591 ± 0.0006**; Optuna tuning confirmed little headroom (best trial 0.95894).
- Final model retrained on full training data (early stopping on a 5% holdout) and test predictions saved as probabilities.
